866
01:19:43,851 --> 01:19:47,987
The team with the highest score
stays on the winner's throne

867
01:19:47,988 --> 01:19:49,989
It's a winner-takes-all format

868
01:19:49,990 --> 01:19:53,960
Only three groups make it to the finals

869
01:19:53,961 --> 01:19:56,451
It's going to be a tough battle

870
01:19:56,475 --> 01:19:59,303
Let's get started!

871
01:20:13,514 --> 01:20:15,715
That's his granddaughter

872
01:20:20,513 --> 01:20:21,113
Ah!

873
01:20:22,022 --> 01:20:23,222
Go, hurry over there

874
01:20:26,894 --> 01:20:28,294
Excuse me

875
01:20:29,289 --> 01:20:32,358
Sorry, you're The Specials, right?

876
01:20:33,826 --> 01:20:34,726
Yes

877
01:20:34,968 --> 01:20:36,258
I saw you in the qualifiers

878
01:20:36,282 --> 01:20:37,170
I'm a big fan

879
01:20:39,006 --> 01:20:41,507
After watching your performance...

880
01:20:41,508 --> 01:20:44,477
I realized dancing isn't just about technique

881
01:20:45,405 --> 01:20:47,406
Passion is really important too, right?

882
01:20:51,485 --> 01:20:52,485
Yes

883
01:20:55,189 --> 01:20:56,889
I'll take my leave now

884
01:21:29,623 --> 01:21:32,191
Alright, thank you!

885
01:21:32,192 --> 01:21:36,529
They were completely in sync
- Incredible level of skill

886
01:21:36,697 --> 01:21:39,465
Judges, please cast your scores

887
01:21:39,766 --> 01:21:44,537
18, 18, 15, 17, 16

888
01:21:44,538 --> 01:21:45,605
The total is...

889
01:21:48,475 --> 01:21:50,051
84 points!

890
01:21:50,075 --> 01:21:56,082
What a shame, they won't advance

891
01:21:57,117 --> 01:21:58,317
Thank you!

892
01:22:01,995 --> 01:22:03,673
Even they got eliminated?

893
01:22:03,802 --> 01:22:05,927
Can we even make the finals?

894
01:22:59,680 --> 01:23:00,525
Ready?

895
01:23:00,549 --> 01:23:03,449
Thank you, everyone!

896
01:23:46,693 --> 01:23:49,195
Tahitian dance is absolutely wonderful

897
01:23:49,196 --> 01:23:51,764
It makes me want to try it myself

898
01:23:51,765 --> 01:23:53,166
Honjo isn't here

899
01:23:53,167 --> 01:23:54,567
Alright, next up...

900
01:23:54,568 --> 01:23:57,336
is a highly anticipated K-POP dance!

901
01:23:57,337 --> 01:24:00,206
His granddaughter is about to go on

902
01:24:02,943 --> 01:24:05,545
It's almost your turn to perform

903
01:24:06,747 --> 01:24:08,114
Could it be he's not coming?

904
01:24:08,115 --> 01:24:09,749
That's impossible

905
01:24:10,017 --> 01:24:13,119
Please welcome Blue Lips to the stage!

906
01:24:14,354 --> 01:24:16,956
You can go

907
01:24:25,199 --> 01:24:25,932
He's here

908
01:24:51,275 --> 01:24:55,422
[RESCENE - Higher]
♪ Even I surprise myself sometimes ♪

909
01:24:55,586 --> 01:24:59,639
♪ I cast a spell on the sky within me ♪

910
01:25:00,338 --> 01:25:04,774
♪ Pull up, pull up, pull up, beep, beep ♪

911
01:25:04,798 --> 01:25:06,860
♪ Pull up, pull up, pull up, beep, beep ♪

912
01:25:06,884 --> 01:25:09,059
♪ Speaking to the sky ♪

913
01:25:09,311 --> 01:25:12,914
♪ Give me more, fill me up with courage ♪

914
01:25:13,356 --> 01:25:17,651
♪ To surprise everyone who dislikes me ♪

915
01:25:17,795 --> 01:25:20,297
♪ Go higher, over the clouds in the sky... ♪

916
01:25:32,633 --> 01:25:33,833
What is this?

917
01:25:34,501 --> 01:25:35,768
I don't know...

918
01:25:38,972 --> 01:25:40,996
We have a new high score!

919
01:25:41,020 --> 01:25:44,544
Blue Lips take the lead!

920
01:25:45,012 --> 01:25:47,180
Congratulations!

921
01:25:51,351 --> 01:25:55,454
Alright, next is...
- The Specials!

922
01:25:55,455 --> 01:25:57,490
Will they be the dark horse?

923
01:25:58,792 --> 01:26:00,193
Let's get to work

924
01:26:01,382 --> 01:26:02,328
Right

925
01:26:21,348 --> 01:26:25,751
♪ It's so Fly-day, Fly-day Chinatown ♪

926
01:26:25,752 --> 01:26:29,222
♪ In the middle of the midnight crowd ♪

927
01:26:49,776 --> 01:26:56,215
♪ A passing foreigner winks at me ♪

928
01:26:57,618 --> 01:27:01,687
Alright judges, please cast your scores

929
01:27:02,565 --> 01:27:08,570
18, 19, 18, 17, 18

930
01:27:09,071 --> 01:27:09,929
The total score is...

931
01:27:11,932 --> 01:27:13,533
90 points!

932
01:27:13,734 --> 01:27:14,734
We did it!

933
01:27:15,202 --> 01:27:19,238
The Specials are currently in third place!

934
01:27:24,378 --> 01:27:26,913
He'll definitely be back

935
01:27:27,714 --> 01:27:30,583
Take him out during the finals

936
01:27:50,470 --> 01:27:53,339
Hey, where did that old man Murasame go?

937
01:27:55,409 --> 01:27:56,976
Did he chicken out?

938
01:27:57,344 --> 01:27:58,277
Go find him

939
01:28:14,428 --> 01:28:16,262
What are you doing here?

940
01:28:19,166 --> 01:28:20,365
Practicing

941
01:28:21,178 --> 01:28:23,703
I don't want to hold everyone back

942
01:28:26,440 --> 01:28:27,806
The finals are about to begin

943
01:28:27,830 --> 01:28:29,675
Please head to the venue

944
01:28:29,676 --> 01:28:31,811
Alright, let's go
- Thank you

945
01:28:31,812 --> 01:28:33,312
Wait
- What?

946
01:28:33,614 --> 01:28:35,366
We need to change into our costumes

947
01:28:35,391 --> 01:28:37,450
Right, I forgot

948
01:28:37,451 --> 01:28:39,051
Hurry up
- Okay

949
01:28:41,288 --> 01:28:42,698
Hey!

950
01:28:43,100 --> 01:28:44,957
You guys look amazing!

951
01:28:44,982 --> 01:28:46,715
Asuka!

952
01:28:47,190 --> 01:28:48,250
What are you doing here?

953
01:28:48,274 --> 01:28:49,295
What about your field trip?

954
01:28:49,296 --> 01:28:51,063
I convinced the teacher

955
01:28:51,465 --> 01:28:54,175
I said, "This is the most important day of my life."

956
01:28:54,200 --> 01:28:55,934
You can't skip class

957
01:28:56,036 --> 01:28:58,571
Excuse us, please get into position

958
01:29:00,073 --> 01:29:01,908
Everyone, gather in the dressing room first

959
01:29:02,543 --> 01:29:03,839
We need to shake off the nerves

960
01:29:03,863 --> 01:29:04,577
Stay here

961
01:29:04,578 --> 01:29:05,411
Okay
- Hurry up

962
01:29:05,412 --> 01:29:07,513
I'll head to the main hall then
- Got it

963
01:29:07,681 --> 01:29:08,648
Hurry up

964
01:29:24,331 --> 01:29:25,898
The plan is off

965
01:29:27,868 --> 01:29:29,368
What did you say?

966
01:29:29,870 --> 01:29:30,930
Asuka is here

967
01:29:30,954 --> 01:29:31,838
It's too dangerous

968
01:29:31,863 --> 01:29:32,789
No

969
01:29:33,448 --> 01:29:34,750
Proceed with the plan

970
01:29:34,775 --> 01:29:35,530
We can't

971
01:29:35,554 --> 01:29:36,209
We'll do it another day

972
01:29:36,210 --> 01:29:37,365
There is no other day

973
01:29:38,445 --> 01:29:41,214
He is right out there

974
01:29:45,267 --> 01:29:47,887
Right, brother Murasame?

975
01:29:49,389 --> 01:29:51,858
I just want to dance

976
01:29:54,895 --> 01:29:57,363
What are you talking about?

977
01:29:57,564 --> 01:29:58,820
I'm sorry...

978
01:30:01,325 --> 01:30:04,070
I really want to dance in the finals

979
01:30:04,071 --> 01:30:05,371
That's all

980
01:30:06,406 --> 01:30:08,708
I know I'm betraying everyone

981
01:30:17,551 --> 01:30:20,953
Kiryu, what about you?

982
01:30:21,488 --> 01:30:24,590
You are going to act like a professional, right?

983
01:30:29,329 --> 01:30:32,098
It's the first time I've ever felt this way

984
01:30:36,236 --> 01:30:37,303
I...

985
01:30:41,074 --> 01:30:42,308
want to dance too

986
01:30:43,477 --> 01:30:44,366
Me too

987
01:30:45,879 --> 01:30:48,347
Besides we might actually win

988
01:30:58,192 --> 01:31:01,116
Fine, I get it

989
01:31:02,429 --> 01:31:04,163
I'll do it myself

990
01:31:07,534 --> 01:31:09,769
If you draw your gun on stage...

991
01:31:11,638 --> 01:31:14,106
I will shoot you

992
01:31:17,010 --> 01:31:18,811
Fine by me

993
01:31:23,517 --> 01:31:25,384
Wait, okay?

994
01:31:25,385 --> 01:31:27,019
Okay

995
01:31:29,723 --> 01:31:31,813
We're finally at the finals

996
01:31:31,837 --> 01:31:33,192
I'm so nervous

997
01:31:33,460 --> 01:31:37,964
The winner will be chosen from
the three remaining teams

998
01:31:41,401 --> 01:31:43,903
First up, The Specials!

999
01:31:43,904 --> 01:31:45,304
Let's begin!

1000
01:32:57,211 --> 01:33:00,947
[TRF - EZ DO DANCE]
♪ EZ DO DANCE, get us away, ecstasy of TRF ♪

1001
01:33:01,415 --> 01:33:03,082
Kuma!

1002
01:33:04,218 --> 01:33:07,820
♪ Look down, just wait, hold the mic, TRF ♪

1003
01:33:08,989 --> 01:33:10,756
♪ And dance freely ♪

1004
01:33:10,757 --> 01:33:14,060
♪ I can hear my voice, it's about to begin ♪

1005
01:33:14,061 --> 01:33:17,597
♪ On a street corner at midnight ♪

1006
01:33:17,598 --> 01:33:24,403
♪ Shedding all lies with aimless friends ♪

1007
01:33:24,471 --> 01:33:27,340
♪ With nothing left and no road ahead ♪

1008
01:33:27,341 --> 01:33:31,277
♪ Where did you come from, you who are dancing? ♪

1009
01:33:31,278 --> 01:33:34,480
♪ Are you running away? Are you leaving? ♪

1010
01:33:34,481 --> 01:33:38,017
♪ So dazzling it's mysterious ♪

1011
01:33:38,018 --> 01:33:41,487
♪ Drawn by dreams, talking to each other ♪

1012
01:33:41,488 --> 01:33:44,991
♪ Damaged fallen angels ♪

1013
01:33:44,992 --> 01:33:48,327
♪ Easy go, easy go, with just a smile ♪

1014
01:33:48,328 --> 01:33:52,098
♪ Connecting this painful moment in a circle ♪

1015
01:33:59,506 --> 01:34:02,542
♪ I've got a feeling breaking through ♪

1016
01:34:02,543 --> 01:34:05,478
♪ By the time the city wakes ♪

1017
01:34:05,812 --> 01:34:09,182
♪ Kissing the morning light ♪

1018
01:34:09,183 --> 01:34:12,218
♪ And embracing those waves ♪

1019
01:34:12,553 --> 01:34:15,988
♪ EZ DO DANCE, EZ DO DANCE! ♪

1020
01:34:15,989 --> 01:34:19,292
♪ I'm watching you dance ♪

1021
01:34:19,293 --> 01:34:22,662
♪ EZ DO DANCE, EZ DO DANCE! ♪

1022
01:34:22,663 --> 01:34:26,666
♪ I'm watching only you ♪

1023
01:34:51,191 --> 01:34:54,827
Thank you!

1024
01:34:54,828 --> 01:34:57,497
That performance was absolutely amazing

1025
01:34:57,498 --> 01:34:59,232
So cool!
- I know!

1026
01:34:59,233 --> 01:35:01,267
Alright, let's begin

1027
01:35:01,268 --> 01:35:04,537
Judges, please cast your scores

1028
01:35:04,538 --> 01:35:09,942
19, 20, 20, 19, 20

1029
01:35:09,943 --> 01:35:11,110
The total is...

1030
01:35:11,411 --> 01:35:14,614
98 points!
- We have a 98!

1031
01:35:14,882 --> 01:35:18,618
Congratulations!
- That's almost a perfect score

1032
01:35:22,256 --> 01:35:24,655
Shiori, get off the stage,

1033
01:35:24,915 --> 01:35:26,392
Quick!

1034
01:35:26,393 --> 01:35:28,194
Hurry up!

1035
01:35:34,568 --> 01:35:37,270
Those people are hitmen!

1036
01:35:39,139 --> 01:35:40,373
Boss?

1037
01:35:40,707 --> 01:35:42,575
They're hitmen!

1038
01:35:48,415 --> 01:35:50,149
Everyone, run that way!

1039
01:35:50,150 --> 01:35:52,251
Go that way, quick!

1040
01:35:55,756 --> 01:35:58,491
Kill them, hurry, get them

1041
01:36:08,168 --> 01:36:09,135
Asuka!

1042
01:36:31,024 --> 01:36:31,791
Dai!

1043
01:36:34,428 --> 01:36:35,194
Get out of the way

1044
01:36:47,975 --> 01:36:48,808
Hang in there

1045
01:36:51,945 --> 01:36:52,845
Kuma!

1046
01:36:53,347 --> 01:36:55,281
Princess, head to the elevator

1047
01:37:19,072 --> 01:37:20,139
We're done for

1048
01:37:21,375 --> 01:37:22,408
Yeah

1049
01:37:29,149 --> 01:37:30,516
Get out of here

1050
01:37:30,817 --> 01:37:31,984
We can't leave you

1051
01:37:32,386 --> 01:37:33,575
Please...

1052
01:37:34,421 --> 01:37:36,723
Let this old man die for a worthy cause

1053
01:38:21,935 --> 01:38:22,768
Hurry up

1054
01:38:23,103 --> 01:38:25,771
Princess, get in the elevator

1055
01:38:41,221 --> 01:38:42,455
Kuma!

1056
01:38:42,723 --> 01:38:45,958
Hang in there

1057
01:38:47,561 --> 01:38:49,061
Kuma!

1058
01:38:52,132 --> 01:38:54,600
How embarrassing

1059
01:38:57,905 --> 01:39:01,641
I thought they were like my family

1060
01:39:02,476 --> 01:39:04,110
I never expected...

1061
01:39:07,147 --> 01:39:09,482
them to betray me

1062
01:39:10,484 --> 01:39:14,787
The job isn't finished yet!

1063
01:39:18,859 --> 01:39:19,926
Princess...

1064
01:39:25,699 --> 01:39:30,937
I really wanted to dance a bit more

1065
01:39:31,772 --> 01:39:33,139
Kuma...

1066
01:40:00,868 --> 01:40:01,701
Hey!

1067
01:40:04,071 --> 01:40:07,640
Hey, is Kuma dead?

1068
01:40:22,322 --> 01:40:24,323
Big Brother!
- Help me!

1069
01:40:25,259 --> 01:40:26,759
Asuka, come here

1070
01:40:28,562 --> 01:40:29,662
Hurry up!

1071
01:40:30,731 --> 01:40:31,731
Kiryu!

1072
01:40:33,033 --> 01:40:36,536
Big Brother, hang in there

1073
01:40:58,725 --> 01:40:59,559
Hey

1074
01:41:01,028 --> 01:41:05,031
Are Gramps and Kuma both dead?

1075
01:41:16,877 --> 01:41:18,044
Asuka

1076
01:41:21,715 --> 01:41:22,668
I...

1077
01:41:24,045 --> 01:41:26,118
have been lying to you

1078
01:41:33,727 --> 01:41:34,894
We...

1079
01:41:38,832 --> 01:41:40,266
are all hitmen

1080
01:41:53,647 --> 01:41:54,747
Hitmen?

1081
01:41:56,583 --> 01:41:58,184
What are you talking about?

1082
01:42:08,962 --> 01:42:09,760
I...

1083
01:42:11,089 --> 01:42:13,089
your parents...
- Don't say another word

1084
01:42:16,970 --> 01:42:19,472
You're my family

1085
01:42:20,807 --> 01:42:22,353
You're important to me

1086
01:42:23,343 --> 01:42:25,645
So please say no more

1087
01:42:26,113 --> 01:42:28,848
Just stay by my side and protect me

1088
01:42:57,644 --> 01:42:58,678
Please

1089
01:43:00,080 --> 01:43:04,350
Your brother wanted my head

1090
01:43:05,385 --> 01:43:08,321
I've already forgotten about it

1091
01:43:08,488 --> 01:43:12,024
Although my subordinate acted on his own...

1092
01:43:12,426 --> 01:43:14,927
I still feel terrible about it

1093
01:43:15,195 --> 01:43:19,332
I'm just glad we resolved this peacefully

1094
01:43:20,033 --> 01:43:22,602
It's finally over

1095
01:43:22,936 --> 01:43:24,937
Please forgive us

1096
01:43:39,419 --> 01:43:41,687
This has nothing to do with me

1097
01:43:41,922 --> 01:43:44,223
Boss, I'll take my leave now

1098
01:44:05,712 --> 01:44:07,914
I had no choice either

1099
01:44:08,549 --> 01:44:11,083
You understand, right?

1100
01:44:12,786 --> 01:44:13,888
Boss

1101
01:44:16,123 --> 01:44:17,913
Thank you

1102
01:44:19,426 --> 01:44:21,304
for taking care of me

1103
01:44:26,166 --> 01:44:27,433
No

1104
01:44:45,185 --> 01:44:47,542
Wait!

1105
01:44:47,566 --> 01:44:48,588
Don't shoot!

1106
01:44:48,589 --> 01:44:49,755
Don't shoot

1107
01:44:52,403 --> 01:44:53,711
Would you pay

1108
01:44:54,728 --> 01:44:57,029
the price of a building to save your life?

1109
01:45:00,123 --> 01:45:00,956
Yes!

1110
01:45:00,980 --> 01:45:02,301
Yes!

1111
01:45:06,540 --> 01:45:07,485
Yes

1112
01:45:08,719 --> 01:45:09,942
I'll buy it

1113
01:45:20,787 --> 01:45:22,522
So The Specials...

1114
01:45:24,858 --> 01:45:26,859
are breaking up?

1115
01:45:27,394 --> 01:45:28,494
Yeah

1116
01:45:28,829 --> 01:45:29,862
Yeah

1117
01:45:30,230 --> 01:45:32,331
We won't see each other again

1118
01:45:46,413 --> 01:45:47,547
Hello?

1119
01:45:51,018 --> 01:45:53,186
The Specials, wait up!

1120
01:46:17,777 --> 01:46:21,690
[Snow Man - Odorouze! / オドロウゼ！(Let's Dance!)]

1121
01:46:21,715 --> 01:46:23,349
♪ Don't you worry ♪

1122
01:46:23,350 --> 01:46:25,251
♪ shining Fighter ♪

1123
01:46:25,252 --> 01:46:27,119
♪ Don't you worry ♪

1124
01:46:27,120 --> 01:46:29,121
♪ endless Desire ♪

1125
01:46:29,122 --> 01:46:30,890
♪ Don't you worry ♪

1126
01:46:30,891 --> 01:46:32,892
♪ tomorrow will be Special ♪

1127
01:46:32,893 --> 01:46:35,962
♪ If you don't dance, you're missing out, A-ha! ♪

1128
01:46:36,129 --> 01:46:37,864
♪ The days are so chaotic ♪

1129
01:46:37,898 --> 01:46:39,732
♪ I really can't take it anymore ♪

1130
01:46:39,733 --> 01:46:43,636
♪ A battle of extreme limits, Get down! ♪

1131
01:46:43,637 --> 01:46:45,271
♪ So tired ♪

1132
01:46:45,272 --> 01:46:47,974
♪ Lately every day feels so numb ♪

1133
01:46:47,975 --> 01:46:52,378
♪ Umm, oh, no, it's not over yet ♪

1134
01:46:52,646 --> 01:46:56,382
♪ Simply put, we are kept alive by dopamine ♪

1135
01:46:56,383 --> 01:46:59,785
♪ By the time we realize, we are puppets ♪

1136
01:46:59,987 --> 01:47:03,089
♪ But as long as I'm with you, UP & DOWN is fun ♪

1137
01:47:03,090 --> 01:47:08,761
♪ This Earth keeps spinning ♪

1138
01:47:08,762 --> 01:47:10,429
♪ It won't stop! ♪

1139
01:47:10,430 --> 01:47:14,133
♪ Just laugh and move to the beat ♪

1140
01:47:14,134 --> 01:47:15,968
♪ PO-PO-POP steps ♪

1141
01:47:15,969 --> 01:47:18,004
♪ Yeah Yeah Yeah Yeah ♪

1142
01:47:18,005 --> 01:47:21,908
♪ Let's watch together till the end credits ♪

1143
01:47:21,909 --> 01:47:25,478
♪ Fever time with you ♪

1144
01:47:25,479 --> 01:47:31,784
